  "notable_quotes": [
    "Pillar-layered MOFs are presented as a flexible design platform because changing the dicarboxylate pillars can tune pore size, shape, and functionality without disrupting the layer motif.",
    "The study synthesized seven isoreticular Zn-triazolate-dicarboxylate pillar-layered MOFs by combining a layered Zn-1,2,4-triazolate motif with varied dicarboxylate ligands.",
    "These seven MOFs were systematically evaluated with six gases—N2, H2, CO2, C2H2, C2H4, and CH4—to probe how geometry and chemistry affect sorption and separation."
